{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/466802-fitting-the-lovecraft-mythology-into-the-world-of-darkness-s-cosmology","id":466802,"title":"Fitting the Lovecraft mythology into the World of Darkness's cosmology?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-02T18:48:02-07:00","id":466802,"title":"Fitting the Lovecraft mythology into the World of Darkness's cosmology?","content":"The Beast thread, in which I posited Cthulhu as a Makara/Ruin Beast, got me thinking...<br /> <br /> Is it possible to fit the whole Lovecraftian mythos into the framework of the World of Darkness, without changing anything on either end? I'm imagining Nyarlathotep, for example, as as an Arch-Qashmal (Lilithim, obviously.)<br /> <br /> You have any thoughts on the matter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5158-xenu-s-paradox","name":"Xenu's Paradox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T19:01:11-07:00","id":466841,"title":"","content":"I'm curious; have we ever seen the G-M's Arch-Angels in &quot;canon&quot; before?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T19:03:12-07:00","id":466843,"title":"","content":"There's a black pharaoh and a King in Ochre in Mummy, along with shit like black angels orbiting dead stars. It's a very Lovecraftian game.<br /> <br /> Both the idigam of Werewolf and the True Fae of Changeling are practically alien gods, as is the God-Machine of Demon. Second Sight covers cults of Things That Should Not Be, both Summoners and Invaders have spooky Lovrcraftian beasties for Mage... the nWoD is not lacking in cosmic horror.<br /> <br /> I wrote up Arkham as a Changeling setting, if you're interested?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T19:08:37-07:00","id":466847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/466802-fitting-the-lovecraft-mythology-into-the-world-of-darkness-s-cosmology?p=466841#post466841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious; have we ever seen the G-M's Arch-Angels in &quot;canon&quot; before?</div> </div> </div> </div>Triage might qualify, He's rank 6, he's in the GMC, and he time travels around like nbd.<br /> <br /> He also might be a machine snake body with a lionhead, I don't recall exactly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T19:31:34-07:00","id":466883,"title":"","content":"Thanks to Mummy and the other things mentioned the World of Darkness is already pretty damn full of Lovecraft.<br /> <br /> I'm planning on making a Deep One once Beast comes out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T19:45:52-07:00","id":466898,"title":"","content":"Ehh... In my opinion, WoD is too empowering to humanity to play well with the Lovecraft mythos. Lovecraft's stories were all about how small and insignificant humans are in the face of omnipotent uncaring gods from the farthest reaches of the cosmos. In the World of Darkness, every single human has the potential within their soul to become a living symbol that can define and re-define reality any way it sees fit, and artificial beings wielding the divine fire would gladly give up their power to become human... I just don't see them meshing well, at least not without damaging a big part of what makes the Lovecraft mythos so horrifying. That said, there are plenty of godlike alien beings in WoD, so it should theoretically be possible if you aren't married to Lovecraft's themes of existential nihilism. Wouldn't be my choice, but different strokes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T19:48:29-07:00","id":466901,"title":"","content":"If you wanted to be accurate, they'd be aliens. At least the more well known members.<br /> <br /> Picture the God-Machine writ large. Their Infrastructure is not the route a delivery truck takes, a factory, lines at a post office. It's nebulae flowing, stars burning, planets circling. Things like Time and the millions of years that Earth passed by without a speck of life on it. Basic laws of physics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-02-2015, 11:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T20:05:48-07:00","id":466909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally 